# Normalize line endings so the repo compiles identically on macOS, Linux, and
# Windows. Without this, Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf=true) get CRLF, which
# trips Prettier/ESLint (`Delete ␍`) and breaks `npm run build` / `lint`.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf`: Git stores all text files as LF and checks them out as LF
# on every platform, regardless of the user's core.autocrlf setting.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files — never normalize or alter.
*.ico  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.eot  binary
*.pdf  binary
